node_cmd_commit -->|"index holds the staged tree"| node_do_read_index
node_cmd_commit -->|"writes blobs, trees, the commit"| node_odb_write_object_ext
node_cmd_commit -->|"branch/HEAD updates go through refs"| node_refs_resolve_ref_unsafe
node_odb_write_object_ext -->|"content hash becomes the path"| node_odb_loose_path
node_odb_write_object_ext -->|"already stored? freshen, don't rewrite"| node_parse_object
node_repo_get_oid -->|"ref names resolve to oids"| node_refs_resolve_ref_unsafe
node_refs_resolve_ref_unsafe -->|"tip oid loads its object"| node_parse_object
node_parse_object -->|"packed objects decoded on demand"| node_unpack_entry
node_unpack_entry -->|"mmap windows over the pack"| node_use_pack
node_try_delta -->|"delta bases read from existing packs"| node_use_pack
node_prepare_revision_walk -->|"each walked commit parsed"| node_parse_commit_buffer

